    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: The average count of quote lines per SBQQ__Quote__c exceeds a healthy threshold.
Why it matters: Very large carts hit CPQ governor limits at calc time, fail to save, or take minutes to recalc. Sales loses confidence in the tool for enterprise deals.
Suppress a finding: when the org genuinely sells large bills of material and infrastructure is sized for it.
Disable the detector: only if quote sizes are intentionally large by design.</value></values>
